sequenceDiagram
  participant U as User
  participant P as VoiceCaptchaPanel
  participant W as Worker index.ts
  participant D as ChallengeCoordinator DO
  participant G as Groq Whisper
  P->>W: GET api challenge
  W->>D: POST create
  D-->>W: challengeId and phrase after pruneExpired
  W-->>P: phrase shown and Record enabled
  U->>P: taps Record then reads the phrase aloud
  U->>P: taps Check
  P->>P: stop recognizer then await MediaRecorder stop event
  P->>W: POST api verify-voice with challengeId and audio blob
  W->>D: GET get id
  D-->>W: phrase and created or 404 if expired
  W->>G: multipart audio with whisper-large-v3
  G-->>W: transcript text
  W->>W: orderedWordScoreFuzzy and bagOfWordsScore then pick reason
  W->>D: POST delete id
  W-->>P: ok reason transcript matchScore humanLikeness note
  P-->>U: human pass line and Play ElevenLabs voice button
